# EN: Keep the migrated asset directory in git while ignoring generated/imported assets.
# 中文：保留迁移后的 assets 目录本身，但忽略后续生成或导入的大资产文件。
/source/SMP_catchball/SMP_catchball/assets/*
!/source/SMP_catchball/SMP_catchball/assets/.gitkeep
